---NetworkConfig reports the relative names of network & subnetwork.
---@class gcp.container_v1.NetworkConfig
---@field gatewayApiConfig? gcp.container_v1.GatewayAPIConfig GatewayAPIConfig contains the desired config of Gateway API on this cluster.
---@field disableL4LbFirewallReconciliation? boolean Disable L4 load balancer VPC firewalls to enable firewall policies.
---@field defaultSnatStatus? gcp.container_v1.DefaultSnatStatus Whether the cluster disables default in-node sNAT rules. In-node sNAT rules will be disabled when default_snat_status is disabled. When disabled is set to false, default IP masquerade rules will be applied to the nodes to prevent sNAT on cluster internal traffic.
---@field defaultEnablePrivateNodes? boolean Controls whether by default nodes have private IP addresses only. It is invalid to specify both PrivateClusterConfig.enablePrivateNodes and this field at the same time. To update the default setting, use ClusterUpdate.desired_default_enable_private_nodes
---@field enableIntraNodeVisibility? boolean Whether Intra-node visibility is enabled for this cluster. This makes same node pod to pod traffic visible for VPC network.
---@field datapathProvider? gcp.container_v1.NetworkConfigDatapathProviderEnum|string The desired datapath provider for this cluster. By default, uses the IPTables-based kube-proxy implementation.
---@field inTransitEncryptionConfig? gcp.container_v1.NetworkConfigInTransitEncryptionConfigEnum|string Specify the details of in-transit encryption. Now named inter-node transparent encryption.
---@field enableMultiNetworking? boolean Whether multi-networking is enabled for this cluster.
---@field enableFqdnNetworkPolicy? boolean Whether FQDN Network Policy is enabled on this cluster.
---@field privateIpv6GoogleAccess? gcp.container_v1.NetworkConfigPrivateIpv6GoogleAccessEnum|string The desired state of IPv6 connectivity to Google Services. By default, no private IPv6 access to or from Google Services (all access will be via IPv4)
---@field ambientNetworkingConfig? gcp.container_v1.AmbientNetworkingConfig Optional. Contains the desired config of Ambient Networking mode on this cluster.
---@field networkPerformanceConfig? gcp.container_v1.ClusterNetworkPerformanceConfig Network bandwidth tier configuration.
---@field network? string Output only. The relative name of the Google Compute Engine [network](https://cloud.google.com/compute/docs/networks-and-firewalls#networks) to which the cluster is connected. Example: projects/my-project/global/networks/my-network
---@field subnetwork? string Output only. The relative name of the Google Compute Engine [subnetwork](https://cloud.google.com/compute/docs/vpc) to which the cluster is connected. Example: projects/my-project/regions/us-central1/subnetworks/my-subnet
---@field dnsConfig? gcp.container_v1.DNSConfig DNSConfig contains clusterDNS config for this cluster.
---@field dataplaneV2Config? gcp.container_v1.DataplaneV2Config Optional. DataplaneV2Config specifies the DPv2 configuration.
---@field serviceExternalIpsConfig? gcp.container_v1.ServiceExternalIPsConfig ServiceExternalIPsConfig specifies if services with externalIPs field are blocked or not.
---@field enableL4ilbSubsetting? boolean Whether L4ILB Subsetting is enabled for this cluster.
---@field enableCiliumClusterwideNetworkPolicy? boolean Whether CiliumClusterwideNetworkPolicy is enabled on this cluster.

---@alias gcp.container_v1.NetworkConfigDatapathProviderEnum "DATAPATH_PROVIDER_UNSPECIFIED"|"LEGACY_DATAPATH"|"ADVANCED_DATAPATH"|"MIGRATE_TO_ADVANCED_DATAPATH"|"MIGRATE_TO_LEGACY_DATAPATH"

---@alias gcp.container_v1.NetworkConfigInTransitEncryptionConfigEnum "IN_TRANSIT_ENCRYPTION_CONFIG_UNSPECIFIED"|"IN_TRANSIT_ENCRYPTION_DISABLED"|"IN_TRANSIT_ENCRYPTION_INTER_NODE_TRANSPARENT"

