---@field loggingConfig? gcp.container_v1.NodePoolLoggingConfig Logging configuration for node pools.
---@field nodeKubeletConfig? gcp.container_v1.NodeKubeletConfig NodeKubeletConfig controls the defaults for new node-pools. Currently only `insecure_kubelet_readonly_port_enabled` can be set here.
---@field containerdConfig? gcp.container_v1.ContainerdConfig Parameters for containerd customization.

---@alias gcp.container_v1.NodeConfigEffectiveCgroupModeEnum "EFFECTIVE_CGROUP_MODE_UNSPECIFIED"|"EFFECTIVE_CGROUP_MODE_V1"|"EFFECTIVE_CGROUP_MODE_V2"

